come?\" questions. Conditional statements will prompt \"True or False?\" questions. Assignment to a result variable (like `ans`) will trigger a \"what value gets assigned?\" question. The UI should display one interactive element at a time before proceeding.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/index.html","EndLine":60,"StartLine":1,"toolAction":"Inspecting top bar in index.html","toolSummary":"Inspect top bar in index.html"}}]}
